{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "%lld frames a second" : {
      "comment" : "Setting: a frame rate of the live pictures",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld Bilder pro Sekunde"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld beelden per seconde"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "95th percentile (ms)" : {
      "comment" : "Measurement: duration 95 percent of moves stay within",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "95. Perzentil (ms)"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "95e percentiel (ms)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About Pairwise" : {
      "comment" : "Menu item that shows the app's name and version",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Über Pairwise"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Over Pairwise"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility" : {
      "comment" : "The system permission Pairwise needs",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bedienungshilfen"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toegankelijkheid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any window" : {
      "comment" : "Setting value: Command joins any window",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beliebigem Fenster"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elk venster"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Command joins with" : {
      "comment" : "Setting: which windows the Command key joins",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Befehlstaste verbindet mit"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Command koppelt met"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a window and hold Command over another window to join them; add Shift to give it the same height, or Control for the other choice of windows. A lock also shows on the seam of windows side by side: click it to join or part them. Holding Command while dragging a joined window parts it too." : {
      "comment" : "How to join and part windows",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ziehe ein Fenster und halte die Befehlstaste über einem anderen Fenster, um sie zu verbinden; mit Umschalt erhält es dieselbe Höhe, mit Control gilt die andere Fensterwahl. Auf der Naht nebeneinanderstehender Fenster erscheint auch ein Schloss: Klicke darauf, um sie zu verbinden oder zu trennen. Auch die Befehlstaste beim Ziehen eines verbundenen Fensters trennt es."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sleep een venster en houd Command ingedrukt boven een ander venster om ze te koppelen; met Shift erbij krijgt het dezelfde hoogte, met Control geldt de andere keuze van vensters. Op de naad van vensters naast elkaar verschijnt ook een slotje: klik erop om ze te koppelen of los te maken. Ook Command tijdens het slepen van een gekoppeld venster maakt het los."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grant Access…" : {
      "comment" : "Button that opens the system's permission prompt",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zugriff erlauben…"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toegang geven…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grant Screen Recording…" : {
      "comment" : "Button that asks for the Screen Recording permission",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bildschirmaufnahme erlauben …"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schermopname toestaan…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
