    "Without it, windows move one at a time." : {
      "comment" : "What happens without Screen Recording",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ohne diese Berechtigung bewegen sich Fenster einzeln."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
